---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="book">
    <div>
      <span class="label eyebrow">Not more rules. A relationship that frees you.</span>
      <h1 class="h1 display balance">The Bible isn't a <em>rulebook.</em><br>It's how you get free.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Somewhere along the way, Scripture got handed to us like a behavior checklist. It was never that — it's a relationship that changes you from the inside, meant to shape everything: how you parent, how you watch the news, how you live on an ordinary Tuesday.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn solid" href="/apps/">Start with a chapter</a>
        <a class="btn outline" href="/about/">Why this exists</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="spine"><div class="ribbon-tab"></div></div>
    <div class="verse-card">
      <span class="verse-mark">&ldquo;</span>
      <p class="verse">It is for freedom that Christ has set us free.</p>
      <span class="verse-ref">Galatians 5:1</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="apps">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div><span class="label kicker">01 — Start Here</span><h2 class="h2 display">Start with a chapter, not a system</h2></div>
    <p class="section-dek">Free tools built for actually opening the text — not another program to maintain, just a place to start.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="apps-grid">
    {% for app in apps %}
    <div class="app-card">
      <div class="app-icon"><img src="{{ app.icon }}" alt="{{ app.name }} app icon"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="app-name display">{{ app.name }}</div>
        <span class="app-status">{{ app.status }}</span>
        <p class="app-desc">{{ app.description }}</p>
        <a class="app-link" href="{{ app.url }}">Download the app →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="podcast">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div><span class="label kicker">02 — Bring It Home</span><h2 class="h2 display">{{ site.podcast.name }}</h2></div>
    <p class="section-dek">Hearing a passage argued out loud by two kids who haven't learned to fake agreement yet — recorded, not rehearsed.</p>
  </div>
  {% set latestEp = collections.episodes | first %}
  {% if latestEp %}
  <div class="podcast-grid">
    <div class="player">
      <div class="wave">
        {% for h in [30,55,40,80,60,35,70,45,90,50,65,30,75,40,55,35,60,80,45,65] %}<i style="height:{{ h }}%"></i>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="player-row">
        <button class="play" aria-label="Play latest episode"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 4l15 8-15 8z"/></svg></button>
        <div class="player-meta"><strong>Ep. {{ latestEp.data.episodeNumber }} · {{ latestEp.data.duration }}</strong>{{ latestEp.data.recordedNote or "Recorded at the kitchen table" }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="ep-title"><a href="{{ latestEp.url }}">{{ latestEp.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p class="ep-desc">{{ latestEp.data.dek }}</p>
      <div class="subscribe-row">
        <a class="pill" href="{{ site.podcast.applePodcasts }}">Apple Podcasts</a>
        <a class="pill" href="{{ site.podcast.spotify }}">Spotify</a>
        <a class="pill" href="{{ site.podcast.youtube }}">YouTube</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="ep-list">
        {% for ep in collections.episodes | limit(4) %}
        {% if not loop.first %}
        <li><span class="ep-num">{{ ep.data.episodeNumber }}</span><span class="ep-list-title"><a href="{{ ep.url }}">{{ ep.data.title }}</a></span><span class="ep-dur">{{ ep.data.duration }}</span></li>
        {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="section on-parchment notepage" id="notes">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div><span class="label kicker">03 — Carry It Into the Week</span><h2 class="h2 display">Carrying Sunday into Monday</h2></div>
    <p class="section-dek">A weekly breakdown of the sermon — because a relationship doesn't end when the building empties out.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="notes-grid">
    {% for note in collections.sermonNotes | limit(3) %}
    <div class="note-card">
      <span class="note-week">Week {{ note.data.week }}</span>
      <div class="note-title">{{ note.data.title }}</div>
      <div class="note-ref">{{ note.data.reference }}</div>
      <a class="note-link" href="{{ note.url }}">Read the breakdown →</a>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <a class="section-foot-link" href="/sermon-notes/">See all sermon notes →</a>
</section>

<section class="section" id="field-notes">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div><span class="label kicker">04 — Everywhere Else</span><h2 class="h2 display">Where the news gets loud</h2></div>
    <p class="section-dek">A relationship doesn't stay quiet during the week. Here's what it has to say about whatever's in the headlines.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="posts-grid">
    {% for post in collections.blogPosts | limit(3) %}
    <div class="post-card">
      <span class="post-tag">{{ post.data.tag }}</span>
      <div class="post-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></div>
      <p class="post-dek">{{ post.data.dek }}</p>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <a class="section-foot-link" href="/blog/">Read more Field Notes →</a>
</section>
